{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-palm-beach-tower-1","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"palm-beach-tower-1-nakheel-properties-dubai-marina","about":"Palm Beach Tower 1, a tower located on Palm Jumeirah Island, is the first building in the prestigious Palm Beach Towers development by developer Nakheel. The complex is designed in a modern urban style. The design of the towers was developed by a large company WS Atkins &amp; Partners. The complex includes residential apartments, stores, as well as a beach club with a park. Apartments are presented with 1-4 bedrooms, as well as two-story penthouses with 4 bedrooms. All residences are exquisitely finished with premium quality materials. Apartments are equipped with balconies, which opens a gorgeous view of the coast.Residents will enjoy a variety of recreational amenities including: yoga area, gym, playground and sports facilities, spa, private beach, waterfront park and promenade, outdoor infinity pool, observation deck, retail stores, lounge, cafe, multi-purpose room, indoor and outdoor children's play areas.The development is located at the entrance to the iconic Palm Jumeirah Island, providing residents with easy access to the Dubai mainland. Within walking distance of the skyscraper are 2 streetcar stations - Palm Jumeirah 1 and Palm Jumeirah 2. Residents will have easy access to key areas of the rest of the emirate: travel time to Dubai Marina will take 10 minutes, and Business Bay and Downtown Dubai can be reached in 20 minutes. Dubai International Airport is 30 minutes away.","price":5175000,"title":"Palm Beach Tower 1","bitrix":{"id":766,"pf_id":null,"source":null,"project_id":"Palm Beach Tower","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Palm Beach Tower","property_type":"Apartment","developer_name":"Nakheel","project_location":"Dubai Marina"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/1176/images/202